# Item list pagination

Use `@webonone/ui-kit` **`ListPageFooter`** below **`ItemList`** on any page that shows a pageable collection. Do **not** drop raw `Pagination` on collection pages — `ListPageFooter` honors the per-user Appearance setting (`pagination` | `on-scroll`).

Skill: [.cursor/skills/item-list/SKILL.md](../skills/item-list/SKILL.md). Store append: [.cursor/skills/feature-store/SKILL.md](../skills/feature-store/SKILL.md).

## Defaults

| Setting | Value |
|---------|--------|
| Mode until prefs load | **`pagination`** |
| Initial `pageSize` | **12** |
| `pageSizeOptions` | **`[12, 24, 48]`** |

`pagination`: pager under the list (same `Pagination` UI). `on-scroll`: hide pager; load the next page when the **page scroller** hits the bottom; **append** rows. Scroll observer root is **not** the viewport: standalone `#main-content`, peer iframe `.platform-embed-shell-main`, optional `scrollRoot` for an inner `overflow-auto` (Media folder browser).

Picker dialogs stay inner-scroll infinite and **ignore** this setting. Public website catalog search stays pager-only.

## Layout

```text
FeaturePage
  ListPageBody
    ItemList          ← flex-1; visible rows
    ListPageFooter    ← mt-auto
```

Sibling order: list then footer inside `ListPageBody`. Wrap list + footer in `ListPageBody`; list in a `flex-1` wrapper. AppShell `#main-content` and embed `.platform-embed-shell-main` are the scrollers.

## Server-paginated (`useEpicCatalogList`)

```tsx
<ListPageFooter
  className="mt-auto"
  totalCount={list.total}
  currentPage={list.page}
  pageSize={list.pageSize}
  pageSizeOptions={[12, 24, 48]}
  loadedCount={list.items.length}
  hasMore={list.hasMore}
  loadingMore={list.loadingMore}
  onPageChange={(p) => list.load(p)}
  onPageSizeChange={(size) => list.load(1, size, true)}
  onLoadMore={list.loadMore}
  onModeChange={() => list.load(1, list.pageSize, true)}
/>
```

Filter / search / pageSize / mode change → page 1 **replace**. Overlay loading is first-page-only (`items.length === 0`).

## Client-sliced (`useClientListPage`)

```tsx
const listPage = useClientListPage(filteredItems)
// listPage.visible → ItemList
<ListPageFooter
  className="mt-auto"
  totalCount={listPage.total}
  currentPage={listPage.page}
  pageSize={listPage.pageSize}
  pageSizeOptions={[12, 24, 48]}
  loadedCount={listPage.loadedCount}
  hasMore={listPage.hasMore}
  onPageChange={listPage.setPage}
  onPageSizeChange={listPage.setPageSize}
  onLoadMore={listPage.loadMore}
/>
```

On-scroll grows `slice(0, loadedCount)` via `nextVisibleCount`. Mode change resets inside the hook — no `onModeChange` needed.

Reference: `CatalogListPage.tsx`, `HistoryPage.tsx`, `CompaniesPage.tsx`, `ScopedFolderBrowser.tsx` (`scrollRoot`). Showcase: `ListPageDemo`.

